  <!-- Upper body: waist_yaw_link fused with everything that used to hang off
       it through a fixed joint -- waist_roll/torso/logo/head and both full
       arm chains (shoulder x3, elbow, wrist x3). None of those have any
       revolute joint before reaching waist_yaw, so they all collapse into
       one rigid body. Fused mass 14.81514202 kg (vs. waist_yaw_link's own
       original 0.214 kg) computed via Pinocchio's rigid-body composition. -->
